  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 104.12 Routine roadway maintenance activities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 104.12 “Routine roadway maintenance activities” means activities that are designed and intended to maintain existing roadways and are included in the Routine Roadway BMPs.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1, #2, #3, and #4 at Chapter heading for Env-Wt 100) #12801, eff 12-15-19",
